"reference_id": 18475,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Jonah 4:3–5",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "32004003-32004005",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Jonah’s desire to die rather than accept God’s will (see also <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:8-Jonah4:9\">Jonah 4:8–9</a>) and his choice to wait in hope that the city would be destroyed (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:5\">Jonah 4:5</a>) show his hard heart (his refusal to change or show mercy) and his hatred for the Assyrians.</p>",
