"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>The Lord responds with a rhetorical question, implying the answer is &quot;No, of course not!&quot; The lesson that follows shows why Jonah should not be angry (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jonah4:6-Jonah4:11\">Jonah 4:6–11</a>).</p>",
